{"ticker":{"symbol":"308080.KQ","name":"바이젠셀","market":"KR","exchange":""},"currency":"KRW","price":4520.0,"change_pct":-0.03829787234042559,"market_cap":92656656384.0,"pe":null,"pb":null,"dividend_yield":null,"week52_low":3070.0,"week52_high":17360.0,"sector":"Healthcare","industry":"Biotechnology","country":"South Korea","city":"Seoul","employees":64,"website":"https://www.vigencell.com","business_summary":"ViGenCell Inc. provides immune cell therapy in South Korea. It develops ViTier, an antigen-specific killer T cell therapy, such as VT-EBV-N for NK/T Lymphoma indications and VT-Tri(1)-A for AML indications; ViMedier, a cord blood-derived myeloid suppressor cell therapy, including VM-GD for GvHD indications and VM-AD for atopic dermatitis indications; and ViRanger, an off-the-shelf allogenic universal T cell gene therapy comprising VR-CAR and VR-GDT for hepatoma and leukemia indications. The company was founded in 2013 and is based in Seoul, South Korea.","business_summary_ko":"ViGenCell Inc.는 한국에서 면역세포치료제를 제공하고 있습니다. NK/T 림프종 적응증을 위한 VT-EBV-N 및 AML 적응증을 위한 VT-Tri(1)-A와 같은 항원 특이적 살해 T 세포 치료법인 ViTier를 개발합니다. GvHD 적응증을 위한 VM-GD 및 아토피성 피부염 적응증을 위한 VM-AD를 포함한 제대혈 유래 골수 억제 세포치료제 ViMedier; 및 간종양 및 백혈병 적응증을 위한 VR-CAR 및 VR-GDT로 구성된 상용 동종 범용 T 세포 유전자 치료법인 ViRanger가 있습니다. 이 회사는 2013년에 설립되었으며 대한민국 서울에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","desc_ko":"","estimates":[{"period":"2026","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null},{"period":"2027","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null}],"ltg":null,"calendar":{},"industry_ko":"바이오","financials":[{"period":"2022","revenue":null,"operating_income":-18213756000.0,"net_income":-17393274500.0,"eps":-916.0},{"period":"2023","revenue":null,"operating_income":-20084447000.0,"net_income":-17875427070.0,"eps":-937.0},{"period":"2024","revenue":278946250.0,"operating_income":-15330478090.0,"net_income":-14055502830.0,"eps":-731.0},{"period":"2025","revenue":22674300.0,"operating_income":-17108466080.0,"net_income":-16322420290.0,"eps":-807.0}],"pri